# Kept out of version control:
#   *.pem            - SSH private key for the (torn-down) EC2 hosts.
#   clrk-src.tar.gz  - rebuildable source bundle shipped to the VMs.
#   workerd-runner   - compiled static binary (build from cmd/workerd-runner).
#   sg.id            - ephemeral security-group id of a deleted resource.
*.pem
clrk-src.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.tar.gz
sg.id
workerd-runner
worker/worker-heavy.js
results/*/results.tgz
